message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DraCor API"
version: 1.1.4
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dracor-org/dracor-api"
url: "https://dracor.org/doc/api/"
abstract: >-
  The DraCor API gives programmatic access to the drama corpora hosted on
  DraCor. It lists corpora and their plays and provides, for each play, its
  metadata, its full text as TEI or plain text, its characters and network
  metrics, and its character network in several formats (CSV, GEXF, GraphML).
